        "created_at": "2013-05-02T01:07:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Recently got my hands on the Oversized Villan cards and some board game time since I am switching internet providers.</p><p>All 3 games I played got crushed against the villans. Though I find the pace for them much more attractive and there is more imminent threat than the regular versions of them.</p><p>Not sure if I was doing anything wrong. Linked the reports of my playthrough.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cosmic Omnitron</p><p>http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/970692/first-run-at-cosmic-omnitron-on-the-block</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mad Bomber Baron Blade</p><p>http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/970700/first-run-at-stopping-the-mad-bomber</p><p>http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/970705/rematch-with-mad-bomber</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
