        "id": 62413,
        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-02T01:39:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sounds about right for MBB. He's kind of swingy, in my opinion, though. With the right card draws, you can almost sit back and play on auto-pilot. But with standard or bad draws, he's a beast. Pile the damage on, and do it quickly. Burn heroes out, if necessary.</p>",
